        "original_id": "153d16a9-c47f-5b69-bde1-1ddddbf6683f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Warren Fu, Aaliyah, R. Kelly, Jay-Z, Mariah Carey, Chloë Sevigny, Carson Daly\n- Companies: Jive, Atlantic Records\n- Works: Soothe My Soul, Death of a Dynasty\n- Topics: music videos, promos, cameo appearances, contract changes, illegal marriage allegations\n\nFacts:\n- Aaliyah ended her contract with Jive and signed with Atlantic Records after allegations of an illegal marriage with R. Kelly.\n- On 28 March 2013, the music video for \"Soothe My Soul\" directed by Warren Fu premiered.\n- Warren Fu has directed promos for Daft Punk, The Weeknd, Snoop Dogg, Pharrell Williams, The Strokes, HAIM, The Killers, Depeche Mode, Weezer, Mark Ronson, Julian Casablancas, and Aaliyah.\n- \"Death of a Dynasty\" includes cameo appearances by Jay-Z, Mariah Carey, Chloë Sevigny, Carson Daly, and Aaliyah.",
